<pre><code>Router.run(routes, Router.HistoryLocation, function (Handler) {
 React.render(&lt;Handler/&gt;, document.body);
});
</code></pre>
<p>This problem does not happen with <code>localhost/</code>, this one always returns what I want.</p>
