Title: Can I pass parameters in computed properties in Vue.Js.
Body: <p>is this possible to pass parameter in computed properties in Vue.Js. I can see when having getters/setter using computed, they can take a parameter and assign it to a variable. like here from <a href="https://v2.vuejs.org/v2/guide/computed.html" rel="noreferrer">documentation</a>:</p>
<pre class="lang-js prettyprint-override"><code>computed: {
