Title: ES6 exporting/importing in index file.
Body: <p>I am currently using ES6 in an React app via webpack/babel.
I am using index files to gather all components of a module and export them. Unfortunately, that looks like this:</p>

<pre><code>import Comp1_ from './Comp1.jsx';
