Title: jQuery same click event for multiple elements.
Body: <p>Is there any way to execute same code for different elements on the page?</p>
<pre><code>$('.class1').click(function() {
   some_function();
});

$('.class2').click(function() {
   some_function();
});
</code></pre>
<p>instead to do something like:</p>
<pre><code>$('.class1').$('.class2').click(function() {
   some_function();
