<p>I have this current setup, <em><a href="https://stackoverflow.com/questions/53243203/react-hook-useeffect-runs-continuously-forever-infinite-loop">React hook useEffect runs continuously forever/infinite loop</a></em> and the only comment is about <code>useCallback()</code> which I'm not familiar with.</p>
<p>How I'm currently using <code>useEffect()</code> (which I only want to run once in the beginning similar to <code>componentDidMount()</code>):</p>
