}
</code></pre>
<p>Where computed property takes an argument and returns the desired output. However, when I try this, I am getting this error:</p>
<blockquote>
<p>vue.common.js:2250 Uncaught TypeError: fullName is not a function(…)</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Should I be using methods for such cases?</p>

