Title: mat-form-field must contain a MatFormFieldControl.
Body: <p>We are trying to build our own form-field-Components at our Company. We are trying to wrap material design's Components like this:</p>
<p>field:</p>
<pre class="lang-html prettyprint-override"><code>&lt;mat-form-field&gt;
    &lt;ng-content&gt;&lt;/ng-content&gt;
    &lt;mat-hint align=&quot;start&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;{{hint}}&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/mat-hint&gt;
    &lt;mat-hint align=&quot;end&quot;&gt;{{message.value.length}} / 256&lt;/mat-hint&gt;
    &lt;mat-error&gt;This field is required&lt;/mat-error&gt;
&lt;/mat-form-field&gt;
</code></pre>
<p>textbox:</p>
<pre class="lang-html prettyprint-override"><code>&lt;field hint=&quot;hint&quot;&gt;
    &lt;input matInput 
    [placeholder]=&quot;placeholder&quot; 
    [value]=&quot;value&quot;
    (change)=&quot;onChange($event)&quot; 
