</code></pre>
<p>This results in approximately this:</p>
<pre class="lang-html prettyprint-override"><code>&lt;textbox  placeholder=&quot;Personnummer/samordningsnummer&quot; value=&quot;&quot; ng-reflect-placeholder=&quot;Personnummer/samordningsnummer&quot;&gt;
