Title: Explain the use of a bit vector for determining if all characters are unique.
Body: <p>I am confused about how a bit vector would work to do this (not too familiar with bit vectors). Here is the code given. Could someone please walk me through this?</p>

<pre><code>public static boolean isUniqueChars(String str) {
