Title: How to return mapping list in Solidity? (Ethereum contract).
Body: <p>I want to make a simple smart contract that has a list, can set item, and can get the list.</p>
<p>Code in solidity:</p>
<pre><code>contract lister {
    mapping(int =&gt; string) list;
    int id = 0;

    function getList() returns ( /*HERE*/ ) {
        return list;
    }

