<p>The red coloring doesn't apply to the <code>a</code> tag elements that were added through slot.
<a href="https://i.stack.imgur.com/YtRxl.png" rel="noreferrer"><img src="https://i.stack.imgur.com/YtRxl.png" alt="" /></a></p>
