Title: OpenLayers 3 Extent of all features on a vector layer?.
Body: <p>I have an OpenLayers 3 map with a base layer and a vector layer. </p>

<pre><code>this.topoLayer = new ol.layer.Vector({
  source: new ol.source.Vector(),
  style: style
});

var baseLayer = new ol.layer.Tile({
